{"parentUuid":"39996ddb-c779-49be-9cea-8216ac9b53fd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01SHTQfkMmZU76oSnrfysfpn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Four clean commits on top of PR #1170's branch:\n\n```\n14d50405e Document Pi in CLAUDE.md\na1d59dcc7 Add Pi to the E2E agent registry\n3b621b97c Drop SessionEnd from pi session_shutdown hook\ndeb60dc70 Resolve Pi sessions from native store\n```\n\n## Summary\n\n**1. `Resolve Pi sessions from native store`** (`deb60dc70`) — the original cold-attach fix ported onto PR #1170. `GetSessionDir` now returns Pi's native store at `~/.pi/agent/sessions/<encoded-repo>/`, `ResolveSessionFile` globs `*_<id>.jsonl`, `GetSessionBaseDir` enables the cross-project fallback. Honors `PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR` and adds `ENTIRE_TEST_PI_SESSION_DIR`. Renamed PR #1170's `piSessionSubdir` → `piHookCacheSubdir` (and moved the constant to lifecycle.go) to make the agent-public-API vs hook-internal split obvious.\n\n**2. `Drop SessionEnd from pi session_shutdown hook`** (`3b621b97c`) — bug I uncovered while running the new e2e canary against PR #1170. PR #1170's TS extension fires `agent_end` and `session_shutdown` async via separate `execFile` child processes; they race, and when `session_shutdown` wins it emits `SessionEnd` and condenses the session before `agent_end` can save its linkable checkpoint. `prepare-commit-msg` then sees a \"fully-condensed ended session\" and the user's commit gets no checkpoint trailer. Reproduced on `TestSingleSessionManualCommit/pi` — fails in 37s before, passes in 8.5s after. The fix is to make `session_shutdown` cleanup-only, no lifecycle event.\n\n**3. `Add Pi to the E2E agent registry`** (`a1d59dcc7`) — `e2e/agents/pi.go` so `E2E_AGENT=pi` is selectable. PR #1170 didn't have e2e coverage (canary used Vogon, not pi); this adapter is what surfaced the race in #2.\n\n**4. `Document Pi in CLAUDE.md`** (`14d50405e`) — agent enumeration + e2e flags + `E2E_AGENT` values.\n\n**Verified end-to-end** (already covered in earlier runs):\n- `mise run lint` — 0 issues\n- All pi unit tests pass (`go test ./cmd/entire/cli/agent/pi/...`)\n- Cold attach against an unhooked pi session resolves the live JSONL and produces a valid checkpoint\n- `TestSingleSessionManualCommit/pi` passes in 8.5s with the race fix (was failing in 37.7s without it)\n\nBranch ready to push as a follow-up PR off `feat/pi-agent-builtin`, or for the PR #1170 author to cherry-pick."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":310,"cache_read_input_tokens":487825,"output_tokens":1024,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":310,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1024,"cache_read_input_tokens":487825,"cache_creation_input_tokens":310,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":310},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CasjX5NsEz9pwBXC3U9Mt","type":"assistant","uuid":"2454e367-311e-4634-8352-76cf09e86c6e","timestamp":"2026-05-09T21:50:40.737Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"824c9ef4-e4d5-49d7-ad05-c34c07511466","version":"2.1.136","gitBranch":"soph/pi-cold-attach-and-e2e"}
